{
  "file_id": "3539",
  "text_count": 235,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "I thought maybe we should get some\nfood.",
      "_offset": 3803,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "He pensado que deberíamos buscar\ncomida."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Oh, good! I'm starving!",
      "_offset": 3844,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si! Me muero de hambre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I'm stuck using a twig for bait.\nI'm hoping fish will mistake it\nfor a worm.",
      "_offset": 3868,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uso una ramita como cebo, a ver\nsi algún pez laconfunde con un\ngusano."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Ah! Something's pulling on it!",
      "_offset": 3945,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ah! Algo está tirando!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Gh...It's heavy...",
      "_offset": 3976,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Hm...Pesa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Help!",
      "_offset": 3995,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ayuda"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Ghhhhhhhh!!",
      "_offset": 4001,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ghhhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Joe?!",
      "_offset": 4013,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Joe?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "And Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 4019,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Y Gomamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "U-ughhhhhh...",
      "_offset": 4032,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "U-ughh...."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What on earth happened?!",
      "_offset": 4046,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué leches ha pasado?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Well...",
      "_offset": 4071,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bueno.."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "This is why I *said* I didn't want\nto go to camp.",
      "_offset": 4079,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por esto dije que NO quería ir al\ncampamento."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "You can tell me that all you want,\nbut I can't do much about it.",
      "_offset": 4129,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Puedes decir todo lo que quieras,\nno puedo hacer nada."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Who else do I say it to, then?\nWe're the only ones here!",
      "_offset": 4194,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "A quién se lo digo si no?\nSomos los únicos aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Yeah, but if we're gonna drift\naround, we should have a bit more\noptimism about it.",
      "_offset": 4251,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si, pero si vamos a seguir\ndeambulando, deberíamos ser algo\nmás optimistas."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "How are we supposed to have a bit\nmore optimism?!\n...Ah...ughhhh...",
      "_offset": 4335,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Como vamos a ser algo más\noptimistas?!\n...Ah!..uhhh.."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Can't really call this\nseasickness. Maybe bedsickness?",
      "_offset": 4403,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uno suele marearse en un\nbarco... pero en una cama?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "What does seasickness have to do\nwith optimism...Hm? A box!",
      "_offset": 4458,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Que tiene que ver el mareo con el\noptimismo...Eh? Una caja!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "You're right!",
      "_offset": 4518,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es verdad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Maybe it's got something to eat!\nLike canned food, or rations.",
      "_offset": 4532,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Quizás tenga comida, algo en\nlata, o raciones!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Grrrrooooooooh!!",
      "_offset": 4595,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Grrroooohh!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4612,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ahhhhhhhh!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Ogremon?!",
      "_offset": 4628,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ogremon!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Sorry, I'm not food! I'm gonna\nbeat you, Chosen Children!",
      "_offset": 4638,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Lamento no ser comida! Os daré\nuna paliza, Niños Elegidos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Nghhhaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4696,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ngghhaaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Nghhhaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4712,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Nghhaaaaaa!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Nghhhaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4728,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Nghhhaaaaaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Whoaaaaa!",
      "_offset": 4744,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "We can't run away! All this bed\nshaking is making me sick!",
      "_offset": 4754,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No podemos escapar! El movimiento\nde la cama me marea!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Attacking at a time like this?\nYou're playing dirty!",
      "_offset": 4813,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Atacas en un momento así?\nMenudo tramposo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Shut up! Take this!\nPuño Imperial!",
      "_offset": 4866,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Calla y come!\nPuño Imperial!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Waaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4906,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Joooooooooooooou!",
      "_offset": 4920,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Joooooooooooee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "We managed to get away...and when\nI thought it was all over, your\nfishing line appeared.",
      "_offset": 4938,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Conseguimos largarnos... y cuando\npensé que ya no había esperanza,\napareció tu sedal."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "We didn't catch any fish, but I'm\nglad it worked out.",
      "_offset": 5027,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No pescamos nada, pero me alegro\nde que sirviese."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "So, I have a favor to ask.",
      "_offset": 5081,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tengo un favor que pedir."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 5108,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "It's about Joe. He's completely\nlost his nerve.",
      "_offset": 5114,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es sobre Joe. Ha perdido el valor\ndel todo."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "He's never been very confident.",
      "_offset": 5162,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Nunca fue muy seguro de sí."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "So, what should we do?",
      "_offset": 5194,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué deberíamos hacer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "We can't have an adventure like\nthis, so let's make him leader to\ngive him some confidence.",
      "_offset": 5217,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No podemos tener una aventura\nasí, lo podemos hacer líder para\ndarle confianza."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Gomamon...Sora? Piyomon? Where is\neveryone?",
      "_offset": 5309,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Gomamon... Sora? Piyomon? Donde\nestán todos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "We just got here, too.",
      "_offset": 5353,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Acabamos de llegar."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "I see.",
      "_offset": 5376,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ya veo"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "That's why we're making you leader\nfrom now on!",
      "_offset": 5383,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por eso serás el líder a\npartir de ahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Ehhh?",
      "_offset": 5431,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ehh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Ehhh?",
      "_offset": 5437,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ehh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Please!",
      "_offset": 5443,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Líder!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Please!",
      "_offset": 5451,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Líder!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "W-wait a minute!",
      "_offset": 5459,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh eh, espera!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "You're the only one who can do it,\nJoe!",
      "_offset": 5476,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sólo tú puedes ser el líder, Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Okay! I'll be the leader!",
      "_offset": 5516,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Muy bien! Seré el líder!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Is that to celebrate me becoming\nleader?",
      "_offset": 5542,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es esta la celebración de líder?"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "I don't think so.",
      "_offset": 5583,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No lo creo."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "The fog's clearing up!",
      "_offset": 5601,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "La niebla se disipa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "The fog's clearing up!",
      "_offset": 5624,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "La niebla se disipa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "There's a church over there!",
      "_offset": 5647,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Hay una iglesia allí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Maybe this time there'll be humans\ninside!",
      "_offset": 5676,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Quizás esta vez sí haya humanos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Let's go check it out!",
      "_offset": 5719,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vayamos a ver!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Wait! Joe is the leader! What\nshould we do, Leader?",
      "_offset": 5742,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Espera! Joe es el líder! Qué\ndebemos hacer, líder?"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "A-ah, but...well...uh...we'll\nall...yeah, let's go!",
      "_offset": 5794,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh.. pero... bueno... eh...\ntodos...si! Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Okay! Maybe we'll finally see\nother humans in that church!",
      "_offset": 5846,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale! Quizás veamos más humanos\nen esta iglesia!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "You're still saying that. It'd be\nconvenient if there were, but...",
      "_offset": 5905,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sigues con esas... Sería práctico\nque fuese así, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "*I'm* the leader here!",
      "_offset": 5972,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "YO soy el líder aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Yeah, but...",
      "_offset": 5995,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Let's go!!",
      "_offset": 6008,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "What's with the sudden pride?",
      "_offset": 6019,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "De donde sale ese orgullo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "He's become more of a leader!",
      "_offset": 6049,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Se está volviendo más líder!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Yeah, but...",
      "_offset": 6079,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Yeah, but...",
      "_offset": 6092,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "What should we do?",
      "_offset": 6108,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué hacemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "The leader should go look!",
      "_offset": 6127,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El líder debería ir a ver!"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Whaaaaat?!",
      "_offset": 6154,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Queee?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Go, Leader!",
      "_offset": 6165,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ve, Líder!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 6177,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale..."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "There really *are* people in\nthere!",
      "_offset": 6185,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Hay gente real aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "No way!",
      "_offset": 6221,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "???!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "What are they doing?",
      "_offset": 6232,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué están haciendo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Looks kind of fun!",
      "_offset": 6253,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Parece divertido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Excuse me, what kind of dance is\nthis?",
      "_offset": 6272,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Disculpa, qué baile es este?"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "This is a carnival where we make\nofferings to the Great Bakemon!",
      "_offset": 6311,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es un carnaval donde hacemos\nofrendas al Gran Bakemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "What's the Great Bakemon?",
      "_offset": 6376,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El Gran Bakemon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "The Great Bakemon is the Great\nBakemon!",
      "_offset": 6402,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El Gran Bakemon es el Gran\nBakemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Huh...",
      "_offset": 6442,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Would you also like to leave\nofferings to the Great Bakemon?",
      "_offset": 6449,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Quieres dejar ofrendas para el\nGran Bakemon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "The Great Bakemon...",
      "_offset": 6510,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El Gran Bakemon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "I know about Bakemon! They're\nghost Digimon who live in the\nOverdell Graveyard, but...",
      "_offset": 6531,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Conozco a Bakemon! Son Digimon\nfantasma, del Cementerio de\nOverdell, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "...They're not exactly a Digimon\nyou'd want to leave offerings to.",
      "_offset": 6618,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "...No son la clase de Digimon a\nquién le daría ofrendas."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "God does not tolerate those who\nspeak ill of the Great Bakemon!",
      "_offset": 6685,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Dios no tolera aquellos que\nhablan mal del Gran Bakemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Sorry.",
      "_offset": 6749,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Perdón"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "We are lucky to have guests come\non our day of carnival.",
      "_offset": 6756,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tenemos suerte de tener invitados\nen nuestro carnaval."
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "We're lucky to have ended up on\nthis island!",
      "_offset": 6813,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tenemos suerte de haber acabado\naquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Joe, there's something really\nsuspicious about these people.",
      "_offset": 6858,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Joe, hay algo muy sospechoso\nen esta gente."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "There's nothing suspicious, miss.",
      "_offset": 6919,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No hay nada sospechoso, señorita."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Gyah! Sorry.",
      "_offset": 6953,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uah! Perdón."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "You've got good hearing.",
      "_offset": 6966,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tienen buen oído."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Have any other children besides us\ncome here?",
      "_offset": 6991,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Han venido otros niños hasta\naquí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Other children? Unfortunately, no.",
      "_offset": 7037,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Otros niños? Desgraciadamente, no"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "I see. I wonder where everyone\nelse is...",
      "_offset": 7072,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ya veo. Me pregunto dónde están\ntodos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "More importantly, want to come\ndance for the Great Bakemon with\nus?",
      "_offset": 7114,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Lo más importante, bailaréis\npara el Gran Bakemon con\nnosotros?"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "No thanks, we'll pass.",
