      "english": "My luck is terrible, I didn't\nthink that going to camp would\nmake all this happen...",
      "_offset": 10334,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Odio mi suerte. No pensé que ir\nal campamento haría que pasase\ntodo esto..."
